// spy-competitor-ads finds, ranks and files. It never rebuilds — the moment the
// ask turns into "and make ours", a cloner owns it, and the offer at the end of a
// sweep is made once rather than acted on.
{"intent":"what is Arcads running on Meta right now","expected_skill":"spy-competitor-ads"}
{"intent":"I want their whole swipe file on disk before Monday's meeting","expected_skill":"spy-competitor-ads"}
{"intent":"pull down every creative these three brands have live and rank them","expected_skill":"spy-competitor-ads"}
{"intent":"which of our competitors has the most creatives in market","expected_skill":"spy-competitor-ads"}
{"intent":"grab the mp4s from the ad library for icon and creatify","expected_skill":"spy-competitor-ads"}
// Indirect: never names a competitor, the Ad Library, or a sweep.
{"intent":"refresh the folder of reference ads we keep, it is months out of date","expected_skill":"spy-competitor-ads"}
// Sourcing a reference is this skill; the rebuild that usually follows is not.
{"intent":"I need a good reference ad to work from and I don't have one","expected_skill":"spy-competitor-ads","ambiguous_with":["clone-image-ad"]}
